Right now, even that is a fact.

427
01:16:42,095 --> 01:16:43,915
ダメだ果てしない
No good, it's endless.

428
01:16:44,015 --> 01:16:48,045
恐いけど知りたい ねぇそれ以上は望んでないよ
It's scary, but I want to know. Hey, I don't wish for anything more than that.

429
01:16:49,145 --> 01:16:52,535
鼓動がやばくない？ ごめん合図を頂戴
Isn't my heartbeat crazy? Sorry, give me a signal!

430
01:16:53,005 --> 01:16:56,675
伝えるまでがミッション ハードモード 叶えて
Until I convey it, it's a mission—Hard Mode, make it come true.

431
01:16:56,895 --> 01:16:58,745
ダメだ果てしない
No good, it's endless.

432
01:16:58,745 --> 01:17:00,795
想定の半分くらい？
About half of what I expected?

433
01:17:00,895 --> 01:17:03,695
もうそれ以上は言えない無理っぽい
I can't say anything more than that, seems impossible.

434
