まだ届いてない？ズキュン合図を頂戴
Still not reaching you? Give me a heart-piercing signal!

435
01:17:07,885 --> 01:17:12,095
伝えるまでがミッション 賽は投げられた
Until I convey it, it's a mission—the die is cast.

436
01:17:14,455 --> 01:17:19,135
伝えるまでがミッション どうにか届いて
Until I convey it, it's a mission—somehow reach them!

437
01:17:21,675 --> 01:17:24,595
待ってて
Wait for me.

438
01:17:28,875 --> 01:17:32,605
伝えるまでがミッション 賽は投げられた
Until I convey it, it's a mission—the die is cast.

439
01:17:43,260 --> 01:17:49,930
Let's Go！ときめいた青空で もっと風に乗り きらめくの
Let's Go! In a heart-fluttering blue sky, riding the wind to sparkle even more.

440
01:17:50,130 --> 01:17:53,760
Dreaming 今より可愛くなりたい
Dreaming, I want to be cuter than I am now.

441
01:17:54,060 --> 01:17:57,770
Cuteな想い ほら何度でも バッキュンだ！
Cute feelings—look, a heart-shot anytime!

442
01:18:11,350 --> 01:18:14,660
瞳にうつる ほうき星
A shooting star reflected in my eyes.

443
01:18:14,920 --> 01:18:18,540
夜空の中 飛び込んだ Shiny Girl
A Shiny Girl who plunged right into the night sky.

444
01:18:18,780 --> 01:18:24,550
手が届きそうなほど 近づく三日月 合図して
Close enough to touch—getting close to the crescent moon, give a signal.

445
01:18:24,930 --> 01:18:27,880
街の明かりを数えたら
When I count the city lights,

446
01:18:28,140 --> 01:18:31,840
眠りにつく枕元 Secret Girl
A Secret Girl at my bedside falling asleep.

447
01:18:32,180 --> 01:18:36,870
まだ見つからない夢 探しに行こう
Let's go search for a dream we haven't found yet.

448
01:18:37,900 --> 01:18:44,870
雨の日でも 晴れの日でも 真っ直ぐに咲いてる花のように
Like a flower blooming straight and tall, whether on rainy days or sunny days.

449
01:18:45,140 --> 01:18:51,250
いつだって きっと どこだって そっと 輝く魔法
A shining magic, always and surely, gently anywhere.

450
01:18:51,930 --> 01:18:58,670
Let's Go！ときめいた青空で もっと風に乗り きらめくの
Let's Go! In a heart-fluttering blue sky, riding the wind to sparkle even more.

451
01:18:58,860 --> 01:19:02,550
Dreaming 今より可愛くなりたい
Dreaming, I want to be cuter than I am now.

452
01:19:02,780 --> 01:19:06,630
Cuteな想い ほら何度でも バッキュンだ！
Cute feelings—look, a heart-shot anytime!

453
01:19:19,900 --> 01:19:26,660
華やかなドレス身に纏い 誰かを待つ 憧れの Princess Girl
Clad in a gorgeous dress, an admired Princess Girl waiting for someone.

454
01:19:26,910 --> 01:19:32,070
あー なりたい理想と比べてばっか
Ah, always comparing myself to the ideal I want to be.

455
01:19:33,360 --> 01:19:39,230
道に迷って 1人悩んで 挫けそうになっても 大丈夫！
Even if I get lost, worry alone, and feel like giving up—it's okay!

456
01:19:39,850 --> 01:19:45,510
君と出会って 笑顔になって 輝く魔法
Meeting you made me smile, a shining magic.

457
01:19:46,450 --> 01:19:52,910
Let's Go！ありふれた日常も もっと風吹いて 動き出す
Let's Go! Even an ordinary daily life starts moving as the wind blows more.

458
01:19:53,110 --> 01:19:56,670
Jumping 飛び立つ希望を探して
Jumping, searching for hope to take flight.

459
01:19:56,960 --> 01:19:59,280
弾ける想い ほら何度でも バッキュンだ！
Bursting feelings—look, a heart-shot anytime!

460
01:20:00,508 --> 01:20:04,648
本当に本当にありがとう
Thank you so, so much.

461
01:20:04,748 --> 01:20:09,648
助けられるだけじゃない 私も守りたい
It's not just about being helped, I want to protect you too.

462
01:20:10,048 --> 01:20:13,908
そうずっと想い描いた 日々を繋いで
Connecting the days I always dreamed of,

463
01:20:14,288 --> 01:20:18,548
重なるいろは やっと気づいた本当の願い
overlapping Iroha, I finally realized my true wish.

464
01:20:22,328 --> 01:20:25,928
なんてちょっぴり大袈裟だけど
That might be a bit of an exaggeration, but

465
01:20:26,288 --> 01:20:30,828
どうかこの時間がいつまでも続きますように
I hope this time will last forever.

466
01:20:31,188 --> 01:20:35,928
君と今 Let's Go! ときめいた青空で
With you right now, Let's Go! In the sparkling blue sky,

467
01:20:36,128 --> 01:20:40,128
もっと風に乗りきらめくの
riding the wind even more and sparkling,

468
01:20:40,128 --> 01:20:43,728
Dreaming 今より可愛くなりたい
Dreaming, I want to be cuter than now,

469
01:20:43,928 --> 01:20:47,528
Cuteな想い ほら何度でもバッキュンだ！
and with cute feelings, shoot you with love anytime!

470
01:20:50,628 --> 01:21:03,328
今日も本当にありがとう！
Thank you so much for today too!

471
01:21:09,328 --> 01:21:18,628
これからもよろしくおねがいします！
I look forward to your continued support!

